        "agm_result": "Agenda #1: Shareholders approved the 2025 Annual Report and Financial Statements audited by Anwar & Rekan, granting full discharge of responsibility to the Board of Directors and Commissioners.\nAgenda #2: The meeting decided not to distribute dividends for the 2025 fiscal year, instead allocating the net profit to retained earnings for business development.\nAgenda #3: The Board of Commissioners was authorized to select an OJK-registered public accountant for the upcoming audit and determine the associated honorarium.\nAgenda #4: Authority was granted to the Board of Commissioners to determine the remuneration, including salaries and allowances, for both the Board of Commissioners and the Board of Directors.\nAgenda #5: Shareholders approved adjusting Article 3 of the Articles of Association to align the company's business activities with the 2025 Indonesia Standard Industrial Classification (KBLI 2025).\nAgenda #6: The meeting accepted the resignation of Michael Ronald Tampi and appointed Sutopo Widodo as a new Commissioner, effective until February 14, 2028.\nAgenda #7: The Directors were granted authority to execute all necessary legal and administrative actions, including signing notary deeds and obtaining government approvals, to finalize changes to the management composition.\nAgenda #8: The Board of Directors consists of Danny Sutradewa, Mariana Irawati Sungkono, and Gusti Angga Rizky Pratama, while the Board of Commissioners includes Chandra, Kevin Cahya, and Sutopo Widodo. All members' terms are set to conclude on February 14, 2028."
      }
